    /*********
    ** Data/Events/Mine — "Kree_CM_UOHGR4IM/Friendship Dwarf 1"
    *********/
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.text-above-head": "Oh, It's you...",
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.speak-1": "Farm human...",
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.speak-2": "There has been a lot of sensation underground lately. Others of my kind have made new advances reclaiming old dwarf technology.",
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.speak-3": "Truthfully, it does not interest me in the slightest. ",
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.speak-4": "...I was thinking someone like you could get more use of it than I ever could.",
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.speak-5": "Go on, give it a closer look.",
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.speak-6": "It's a Powered Chest...",
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.message-warm-to-touch": "It's warm to the touch.",
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.question-option-1": "How does this work?",
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.question-option-2": "I'll take it off your hands",
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.split-speak-1": "It's the main component to powered automation. It can move items to and from machines and chests connected by conduit.",
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.split-speak-2": "Also it in itself is a power source!",
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.after-event-dwarf": "Don't worry, that Powered Chest is on me. I don't think that Goblin was ever going to buy it.",
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.after-event-henchman": "'Powered chest?'... I don't know of such a thing.",
    // used the wrong format for this message in the cutscene, just have the same text on both sides of the '~'
    "event.dwarf-friendship-1.shop-intro": "I sell all the things that could help you get started. I even got my hands on some research notes that might prove useful.~I sell all the things that could help you get started. I even got my hands on some research notes that might prove useful.",

    /*********
    ** Data/Events/Mountain — "Kree_CM_YI2YFDQB/"
    *********/
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-1": "Hmm. This has to be it.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-2": "Eighth time's the charm.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-3": "oh, that sounds promising.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-4": "Phew... The tolerances are a little tight, but it's as perfect as it's gonna get.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-5": "Yep, now it's a matter of giving it a good crank.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-6": "Dad, did you run back for cover while I tightened that last bolt?",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-7": "Oh, well... I just thought I could get a better view of it from here!",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-8": "Hey look, it's the new farmer, maybe they can give us a hand.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-9": "...",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-10": "Well, maybe some farm elbow grease is just exactly what we need.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-11": "Hi @, do you think you could lend us a hand here?",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-12": "After Joja cleared that landslide, my dad found a curious scroll containing blueprints for this power device.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-13": "I was studying the ecological aftermath of Joja's drilling fiasco when I stumbled upon these loose research notes.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-14": "The notes were quite indecipherable, but the drafting is remarkably precise. Maru and I spent the entire day reverse-engineering the designs.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-15": "There was even the most interesting cave carrot purée recipe on the back.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.text-above-head-1": "Too earthy...",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-16": "Id rather not think about that.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-17": "If its not too much trouble, @, would you mind giving it a crank? We haven't had much luck ourselves.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.message-1": "The cranked power coil turned on.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-18": "Wow, that actually worked!",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-19": "According to the note's drawings, this coil is pulling energy from beneath the ground.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-20": "It's like there's some sort of power source hidden deep beneath Stardew Valley. So much research potential!",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-21": "Also Maru, was it really necessary to use me as a shield?",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-22": "Haha, I was just thinking I could get a better view of it from here is all!",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-23": "Ahem... Thanks again @, I think you deserve blueprints of your own for your assistance.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.message-2": "Learned how to craft a 'Cranked Power Coil'",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-24": "I'm sure this cranked power coil will help tons powering some of your farm equipment.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-25": "Oh, hey there, champ! Nice to see you out of the house for once.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-26": "...",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.speak-27": "That wasn't because of me, was it?",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.after-event-maru": "Thanks again for helping out, @. It was fun tinkering with my dad, anyway.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.after-event-demetrius": "Maru is a bright young girl. I just wish Sebastian would share more of his interests with me...",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.after-event-sebastian": "Sorry if I came off a little rude earlier... I guess I just got embarrassed.",
    "event.cranked-power-coil-intro.after-event-robin": "Maru gave you a blueprint for that cranked machine? Demetrius and her nearly broke a window messing with that thing. ",

