    "special-order.cave-carrot-request.objective-collect": "Collect 50 cave carrots",
    "special-order.cave-carrot-request.objective-donate": "Place 20 pickled cave carrots in the dwarf's chest inside the mines.",
    "special-order.cave-carrot-request.completion-letter": "[letterbg 0]Farm human @,^^Thank you for the pickled cave carrots. I spent some time sorting them by quality, and thought you could make some quality tags of your own to sort items by qaulity.^^I placed this note in your mailbox during the night. You have a nice surface farm in the valley.%item craftingrecipe luisMint.PoweredAutomation_NoQualityTag %%%item craftingrecipe luisMint.PoweredAutomation_SilverQualityTag %%%item craftingrecipe luisMint.PoweredAutomation_GoldQualityTag %%%item craftingrecipe luisMint.PoweredAutomation_IridiumQualityTag %%"
